@page "/dining"
<PageTitle>Taniti : Dining</PageTitle>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/placeholder.png"
                 alt="Dining Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-start dining-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Dining
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @* <h2 class="card-title">Dining</h2> *@
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti offers a compact but diverse dining scene, giving visitors a mix of local island
                    flavors and familiar American and Pan‑Asian options. Whether you want fresh fish and rice
                    or something more traditional, the island’s restaurants provide several convenient choices.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">10 restaurants total</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">5 serve local fish and rice</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">3 serve American‑style meals</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">2 serve Pan‑Asian cuisine</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/placeholder.png"
                 alt="Groceries Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-start dining-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Groceries
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @* <h2 class="card-title">Groceries</h2> *@
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti makes it easy for visitors to stock up on food and essentials. With supermarkets,
                    smaller grocery stores, and a 24‑hour convenience shop, you’ll always have access to what
                    you need during your stay.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">2 supermarkets</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">2 smaller grocery stores</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">1 convenience store open 24 hours</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
